# Build output. Every image in here embeds the whole of Video Olympics, so this
# has to stay out for the same reason rom/ does, quite apart from being generated.
build/

# THE CARTRIDGE ITSELF IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# Video Olympics is Atari's, 1977, written by Joe Decuir. This project is a
# patch and a server; it is not a place to redistribute the game. Supply your
# own dump -- see rom/README.md for the file and the md5 the build checks
# against. rom/video-olympics.asm is generated from that dump by
# `make disasm` and is likewise not redistributed here.
rom/*.bin
rom/*.asm

# The C relay's binary. server/c/ itself is source and belongs in the tree.
server/c/vo-relay

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editors and the usual detritus
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
